  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: To contribute to reducing the vulnerabilities of conflict-affected and vulnerable communities in Lebanon through integrated WaSH and Shelter services in Bekaa and South LebanonOutcome 1: 13,452 individuals will benefit of improved access to WaSH services through infrastructural rehabilitation or upgrades for conflict-affected communities in Baalbek-Hermel and SouthOutcome 2: Conflict-affected households and/or those at risk of eviction benefit from improved security of tenure in Bekaa and South region</narrative>
  </description>
